---
source: src/shell_selection/selection/tests.rs
expression: rendered
---
Empty: a shell name must not be empty
TooLong { length: 64 }: a shell name must be at most 63 bytes, but has 64
InvalidFirstCharacter { character: 'B' }: a shell name must start with a lower-case ASCII letter, not 'B'
InvalidCharacter { character: '/', char_index: 2 }: invalid shell name character '/' at character 2
ReservedWord { word: "true" }: shell name "true" is a reserved YAML Boolean; use an unquoted Boolean instead
number: invalid type: integer `1`, expected a Boolean or a shell name
